WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:49.250 --> 01:52.840
Louie, let's go. The guests are waiting.

01:55.760 --> 01:58.720
We must entertain our guests.

02:04.100 --> 02:10.770
Luxury Cruise, Monkey Panic

02:17.360 --> 02:20.870
Thank you for inviting me, Marianne.

02:20.870 --> 02:23.240
Please enjoy your stay.

02:29.370 --> 02:33.380
This is a costume party so they could be hiding anywhere.

02:33.380 --> 02:35.670
Don't let your guard down, Class President.

02:36.550 --> 02:38.420
Marianne Toudou.

02:38.420 --> 02:42.680
A model and the president of Minazuki Productions.

02:42.680 --> 02:44.310
And that is...

02:44.310 --> 02:51.310
The Grand Marine. Legend has it that whoever possesses this blue diamond...will become conqueror of the sea.

02:51.310 --> 02:55.900
What a beautiful jewel. I envy her for having that.

02:55.900 --> 03:02.370
However, there are rumors that the Kaitous have sent notices targetting the diamond.

03:02.370 --> 03:04.620
Oh, who are they?

03:04.620 --> 03:08.540
Those who have been society's burden lately, Kaitou Sinbad and...

03:09.660 --> 03:11.670
...Kaitou Jeanne!

03:12.540 --> 03:16.630
That's the Grand Marine, our text target!

03:18.170 --> 03:23.970
Haruta-san, Natsuda-san, Akita-san and Fuyuta-san, too.

03:23.970 --> 03:26.220
It's well-guarded.

03:26.220 --> 03:28.390
What are you going to do, Maron?

03:28.390 --> 03:30.770
I have a good plan.

03:30.770 --> 03:31.940
Fin, please.

03:38.860 --> 03:41.740
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

03:48.410 --> 03:50.370
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

03:50.370 --> 03:52.170
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

03:52.170 --> 03:53.460
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

04:00.380 --> 04:01.970
The Grand Marine.

04:01.970 --> 04:04.720
It's beautiful, no matter how often I see it.

04:04.720 --> 04:06.720
Oh, Captain.

04:06.720 --> 04:12.730
As a man of the sea, it's something I would love to possess.

04:12.730 --> 04:17.020
Anyway, President, there are rumors that we can't just ignore.

04:17.020 --> 04:20.400
Maybe you should postpone tonight's party for another night.

04:20.400 --> 04:25.360
It will be fine. The detectives here have all agreed to stand guard at the party.

04:25.360 --> 04:30.200
I'm a detective from Momokuri and a Jeanne specialist, Toudaiji Himuro.

04:30.200 --> 04:33.000
I'm Kishida, the captain of this ship. Nice to meet you.

04:33.000 --> 04:39.300
As you can see, Captain, you can relax and enjoy your last cruise.

04:39.670 --> 04:42.590
Well, I have business to attend to so please excuse me.

04:44.760 --> 04:47.180
What does she mean by "last cruise?"

04:47.180 --> 04:51.520
The captain will retire after tonight's cruise.

04:51.520 --> 04:54.850
Why? He looks like he can still handle the job.

04:54.850 --> 05:01.530
The latest ships are all computerized and it seems that the technology does all the work.

05:01.530 --> 05:05.030
So, veterans like the captain...

05:05.030 --> 05:07.110
...aren't necessary, huh?

05:08.660 --> 05:16.920
When I was a kid, the captain would tell wonderful tales about being a man of the sea.

05:23.170 --> 05:25.720
I see... Okay!

05:25.720 --> 05:31.180
I won't let either Jeanne or Sinbad interrupt the captain's last cruise!

05:31.180 --> 05:32.430
Got it?

05:32.430 --> 05:33.140
Yes!

05:35.270 --> 05:38.400
They say a forest is the best place to hide a leaf.

05:38.400 --> 05:39.860
Nice thinking, Jeanne!

05:39.860 --> 05:43.570
No one can tell who you are if you're wearing a costume!

05:43.570 --> 05:44.900
You're so clever!

05:44.900 --> 05:47.030
I know, right.

05:47.030 --> 05:49.370
Well, I thought it was good...

05:51.450 --> 05:55.160
I guess there was no need to wear a costume...

05:58.880 --> 06:01.210
Well, good luck, Jeanne!

06:02.380 --> 06:05.460
What the hell is this?!

06:05.460 --> 06:08.380
I guess the costumes were pre-arranged...

06:08.380 --> 06:13.510
You've got to be kidding! Think about the people who have to guard the place!

06:17.980 --> 06:24.070
By the way, it's too bad that Kusakabe-san and Nagoya-kun couldn't come.

06:24.070 --> 06:30.490
Yeah, how odd for them <i>both</i> to catch a cold when you invited them to the party.

06:30.490 --> 06:33.910
They're like two peas in a pod.

06:43.040 --> 06:47.840
Oh man, I wanted to dance with Kusakabe-san...

06:48.170 --> 06:53.800
It's me. You can't tell when they'll show up so don't let your guard down.

06:53.800 --> 06:57.730
Haruta, roger. Nothing suspicious at the entrance.

06:57.730 --> 07:00.730
Natsuda, roger. No problems here.

07:01.600 --> 07:07.110
Akita here. No suspicious people at the ballroom entrance.

07:07.110 --> 07:12.320
Fuyuta here. No sign of any suspicious flying objects on the deck.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.160
<i>What should I do?</i>

07:20.160 --> 07:26.170
<i>I could approach the target while dancing, but I have no partner...</i>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.050
Miss, may I have this dance with you?

07:33.550 --> 07:35.430
Yes, with pleasure!

08:10.670 --> 08:12.170
Those two...

08:16.800 --> 08:18.760
In the name of God...

08:18.760 --> 08:21.480
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

08:21.480 --> 08:23.350
I seal you here!

08:32.110 --> 08:33.240
The Grand Marine!

08:33.240 --> 08:34.660
What?!

08:34.660 --> 08:35.450
It's been stolen!

08:35.450 --> 08:36.240
It's Jeanne's doing!

08:36.240 --> 08:37.320
Or Sinbad?!

08:37.320 --> 08:38.950
Detective!

08:38.950 --> 08:41.040
Seal the ballroom immediately!

08:41.040 --> 08:45.500
- We'll start a search of everyone! Hurry!

08:43.910 --> 08:45.500
- Please wait!

08:45.500 --> 08:49.420
I don't want anyone inconvenienced because of me.

08:49.420 --> 08:50.500
But...!

08:50.500 --> 08:55.720
Everyone! I'm very sorry! Everything will be fine!

08:55.720 --> 09:01.310
These detectives will find the jewel, so please continue with the party!

09:01.310 --> 09:03.140
Music!

09:11.940 --> 09:14.110
Are you going to leave it at that, Dad?!

09:15.610 --> 09:23.910
Okay. Haruta and Akita, you guys go check the guest list and look for anyone suspicious.

09:23.910 --> 09:26.870
Natsuda and Fuyuta, you guys search the ship thoroughly.

09:26.870 --> 09:27.580
Roger!

09:29.460 --> 09:32.460
Allow me to have some fun.

09:39.970 --> 09:44.890
I almost got the Demon possessing the Grand Marine!

09:44.890 --> 09:47.190
Darn that Sinbad!

09:47.190 --> 09:50.230
- I didn't do anything, Jeanne.

09:52.020 --> 09:53.400
You!!!

09:54.690 --> 09:58.410
Don't lie! The Grand Marine is gone!

09:58.410 --> 10:04.250
It's your choice to believe me or not but there is someone else challenging us.

10:05.410 --> 10:05.830
What?

10:17.470 --> 10:19.260
No response...<i></i>

10:21.760 --> 10:24.970
I still think Sinbad took it.

10:24.970 --> 10:27.690
I should never have listened to a servant of the Devil!

10:32.150 --> 10:32.900
What the...?

10:41.660 --> 10:47.160
I thought it was possible that the owner still had it, but it's not in her room.

10:58.760 --> 11:00.470
How odd...

11:01.220 --> 11:04.390
Why is it reacting everywhere periodically?

11:04.390 --> 11:06.470
You there! Excuse me!

11:06.470 --> 11:07.520
Uh, yes?

11:07.520 --> 11:11.690
You were just dancing very badly in the ballroom, weren't you?

11:13.110 --> 11:16.030
Y-Yes... What about it?

11:16.030 --> 11:19.900
Could you take off that mask and show me your face?

11:22.320 --> 11:24.990
Notice

11:22.320 --> 11:24.990
Don't go away!

11:22.320 --> 11:24.990
I'll return right after these messages!

11:22.320 --> 11:24.990
Kaitou Jeanne

11:25.910 --> 11:28.500
Notice

11:25.910 --> 11:28.500
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:25.910 --> 11:28.500
Kaitou Jeanne

11:28.830 --> 11:33.130
What's wrong? Is there a reason why you can't show your face?

11:33.130 --> 11:37.670
It should not be an imposition if you aren't trying to hide anything.

11:56.190 --> 11:57.440
Louie!

11:58.440 --> 12:02.570
How did you get in here?

12:02.570 --> 12:05.320
You're a very bad boy, aren't you?

12:08.660 --> 12:09.950
This is...

12:11.790 --> 12:14.290
Now, show me your face!

12:14.290 --> 12:18.550
Or do you admit that you are Kaitou--

12:18.550 --> 12:20.420
Wait just a second!

12:21.840 --> 12:25.800
She is my friend and an important guest.

12:25.800 --> 12:27.640
A friend...?

12:27.640 --> 12:28.430
Yes.

12:38.020 --> 12:43.280
Y-Yes! We became acquainted as models! I'm Esprit. So long!

12:48.660 --> 12:49.870
What is it?

12:49.870 --> 12:53.210
<i>This is Natsuda. I found Sinbad on Deck C!</i>

12:53.210 --> 12:56.420
We're pursuing him now! Requesting assistance!

12:56.420 --> 12:58.210
Let's go, Class President!

12:58.210 --> 12:58.920
O-Okay!

13:00.420 --> 13:01.840
Stop!

13:01.840 --> 13:03.550
Stop, damn it!

13:03.550 --> 13:05.840
How careless of me!<i></i>

13:09.010 --> 13:12.810
She helped me, but what is she thinking?

13:12.810 --> 13:16.560
Did you find what you were looking for, Esprit-san?

13:16.560 --> 13:19.230
Or is it...Kaitou Jeanne?

13:21.570 --> 13:25.360
It looks like you still haven't found the Grand Marine.

13:25.360 --> 13:27.410
I win!

13:33.750 --> 13:36.250
<i>The Petit Claire is not responding to her!</i>

13:36.250 --> 13:40.210
<i>Does that mean she's not possessed by a Demon?</i>

13:45.300 --> 13:48.510
Where could the Grand Marine be?

13:49.510 --> 13:50.430
What?

13:51.850 --> 13:54.310
<i>This pain... Is it the Demon..?</i>

13:54.310 --> 13:55.930
Huh? It doesn't hurt anymore.

14:05.740 --> 14:07.070
Him?

14:18.120 --> 14:21.750
That blackout! That was set up by you!

14:21.750 --> 14:22.920
Why?!

14:22.920 --> 14:25.130
It's a tremendous party!

14:25.130 --> 14:32.010
I was thinking it needed some excitement, when you two sent me notice cards.

14:32.010 --> 14:34.430
I couldn't resist using them to my advantage.

14:34.430 --> 14:37.480
Thanks to you, a boring party is now a hit!

14:39.520 --> 14:44.020
But it's time to end this game.

14:44.980 --> 14:48.650
This is a gadget the detective lent me.

14:48.650 --> 14:54.370
If I push it, the guards on this ship will all come here.

14:54.370 --> 14:56.370
It was fun.

14:57.200 --> 14:58.330
Farewell.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.920
Wh-What is this?!

15:14.930 --> 15:18.270
Where did Sinbad run off to?

15:20.060 --> 15:21.560
What is this?!

15:21.560 --> 15:23.610
The ship's moving.

15:24.730 --> 15:25.980
What about it?

15:25.980 --> 15:29.400
It's a ship, for heaven's sake. Of course it moves!

15:29.400 --> 15:30.860
It's not that.

15:30.860 --> 15:33.780
This ship.. This ship...!

15:34.580 --> 15:36.700
What's happening?!

15:36.700 --> 15:39.960
This ship is not supposed to move until tomorrow morning!

15:39.960 --> 15:44.210
The main program went berserk and started moving the ship automatically!

15:44.210 --> 15:48.300
If the ship continues at this pace, it'll crash into the harbor in a matter of minutes!

15:52.720 --> 15:54.470
Oh no!

15:54.470 --> 15:55.300
Jeanne!

15:56.310 --> 15:56.970
Fin!

15:56.970 --> 16:01.100
The captain has been possessed by the Demon!

16:01.100 --> 16:03.730
Then the captain has the Grand Marine?!

16:03.730 --> 16:06.820
I don't really know!

16:06.820 --> 16:08.730
It's okay, Fin. Thanks.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.740
Where is the Grand Marine? Tell me!!!

16:18.450 --> 16:19.240
No way.

16:23.120 --> 16:26.460
Everyone might die because of your stupid games!

16:34.130 --> 16:35.260
Louie has it.

16:35.260 --> 16:36.640
Louie?

16:36.640 --> 16:38.220
My pet monkey...

16:38.220 --> 16:40.180
Where is he now?

16:40.180 --> 16:45.900
I don't know! I let him go to confuse all of you!

16:58.030 --> 16:59.540
Why doesn't it open?!

16:59.540 --> 17:04.210
The auto-lock has activated due to am error in the program!

17:04.210 --> 17:08.790
We're trying to fix the program using the sub-control system, but...

17:10.960 --> 17:12.920
What? The captain!

17:12.920 --> 17:14.720
What!

17:14.720 --> 17:16.640
Can't we communicate with him?

17:16.640 --> 17:20.430
It's no use! All communication channels are shut down!

17:20.430 --> 17:24.690
The door is sound-proof, and nothing can be heard from inside!

17:24.690 --> 17:25.980
Damn!

17:27.190 --> 17:32.610
Maybe the captain is trying to do something by himself!

17:32.610 --> 17:35.150
Captain...

17:39.200 --> 17:44.040
Sinbad, we're in trouble if we don't <i>Checkmate</i> soon and stop the ship!

17:44.040 --> 17:48.080
I know, but the location of the target is still unknown.

17:49.380 --> 17:50.000
What is it?!

17:50.000 --> 17:52.710
Sinbad... The Demon!

17:56.090 --> 17:57.260
The Grand Marine!

17:57.260 --> 17:57.880
What?!

18:01.510 --> 18:03.310
Wait!

18:03.310 --> 18:06.140
I'll leave it to you, Sinbad!

18:06.690 --> 18:10.230
Louie-chan! Where are you?

18:14.570 --> 18:16.780
Obviously, he's not just going to give himself up...

18:21.370 --> 18:22.490
Stop!

18:31.920 --> 18:33.420
You little...!

18:35.920 --> 18:37.130
Eat my dust!

18:53.610 --> 18:55.400
In the name of God...

18:55.400 --> 18:58.400
You, a Demon... born in darkness...

18:58.400 --> 19:00.820
I...seal you here...

19:08.330 --> 19:11.210
Sorry for chasing you.

19:12.830 --> 19:16.090
Come here, I won't hurt you.

19:16.090 --> 19:16.760
Okay?

19:24.050 --> 19:25.220
Louie!

19:30.730 --> 19:31.940
Louie!

19:39.650 --> 19:41.070
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:54.080 --> 19:55.170
Captain!

19:55.170 --> 19:57.800
- Are you okay?

19:55.920 --> 19:57.800
- Captain, hang in there!

19:59.460 --> 20:01.300
What was I...?

20:02.220 --> 20:04.300
Oh no! The harbor!

20:04.300 --> 20:05.930
What are you doing?!

20:05.930 --> 20:08.680
Uh, but the program is still...

20:09.730 --> 20:11.770
Who cares about the program?!

20:11.770 --> 20:16.060
We have our own skills to rely on!

20:16.060 --> 20:17.610
Deactivate auto-pilot!

20:17.610 --> 20:18.730
Reverse the propellers!

20:18.730 --> 20:21.650
Decelerate to the max!

20:21.650 --> 20:23.110
Steer to the right!

20:23.110 --> 20:24.530
Yes, sir!

20:24.530 --> 20:25.700
Deactivate auto-pilot!

20:25.700 --> 20:26.740
Reverse the propellers!

20:26.740 --> 20:29.540
Decelerate to the max!

20:45.800 --> 20:47.800
Everything's wrapped up!

20:54.520 --> 20:56.310
Here I go!

21:00.400 --> 21:05.240
Stop it, Nagoya-kun! You nearly knocked me over!

21:06.240 --> 21:07.620
What's wrong?

21:07.620 --> 21:13.370
You guys caught a cold together and recovered at the same time. You guys sure are...

21:13.370 --> 21:14.660
...like two peas in a pod?

21:14.660 --> 21:16.670
Yeah yeah, whatever...

21:17.330 --> 21:19.090
Hey, Fin...

21:19.090 --> 21:20.920
Yes?

21:20.920 --> 21:25.180
Why wasn't Marianne possessed by the Demon?

21:25.180 --> 21:32.140
Hmm... I guess a Demon only possesses those it believes to have beautiful hearts.

21:32.140 --> 21:37.600
Maybe those who enjoy worrying others don't have beautiful hearts.

21:37.600 --> 21:42.730
It's kind of sad being unable to feel beautiful inside...

21:42.730 --> 21:43.940
Maron!

21:44.900 --> 21:47.610
What are you doing? Come over here!

21:48.320 --> 21:49.530
Right away!

21:51.080 --> 21:52.540
Here I come!

21:57.040 --> 21:58.960
Get off me, Class President!

22:05.510 --> 22:11.350
For billions of years,

22:11.430 --> 22:20.900
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.070 --> 22:29.530
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.780 --> 22:35.830
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.450 --> 22:39.250
The huge mountains...

22:41.960 --> 22:48.880
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.380 --> 22:53.930
It took everything.

22:56.180 --> 23:02.150
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.230 --> 23:09.150
we watched the world ending...

23:09.360 --> 23:15.240
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.370 --> 23:25.000
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.300 --> 23:35.060
Maron, I don't know about this training camp...

23:35.060 --> 23:38.180
You're worrying too much. It'll be fine.

23:38.180 --> 23:40.020
Huh? Miyako, did you hear that sound...?

23:40.020 --> 23:42.940
Ahhhhhh! I-I'm not afraid at all!

23:42.940 --> 23:45.110
Who's scared of ghosts?! Not Toudaij--

23:45.110 --> 23:48.230
Ahh! Miyako, what's with that hand on your shoulder?

23:48.230 --> 23:50.360
Ahh! Miyako, there's another on the other!

23:51.200 --> 23:52.990
T-Two of them...

23:52.990 --> 23:56.370
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Ghost Story! Summer of the Haunted School

23:57.200 --> 24:00.000
Huh? That girl...
